1
00:00:00,561 --> 00:00:02,891
(Leonard:)No, we just made out.

2
00:00:02,897 --> 00:00:04,897
(Mandy:)Oh. Well, good for me.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,870
(Mandy:)So what can I do for you?

4
00:00:07,869 --> 00:00:11,299
(Leonard:)Uh, okay, well, um,
I got married recently.

5
00:00:11,305 --> 00:00:12,675
Oh, congratulations!

6
00:00:12,673 --> 00:00:15,173
(Mandy:)To Sheldon?

7
00:00:15,176 --> 00:00:16,576
(chuckles)

8
00:00:16,577 --> 00:00:18,177
(Leonard:)Never gets old.

9
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:20,879
(Leonard:)No, no, to a girl.

10
00:00:20,882 --> 00:00:23,252
(Leonard:)Anyway, I told her what happened
between you and me,

11
00:00:23,251 --> 00:00:25,981
(Leonard:)and she's concerned about us
seeing each other at work.

12
00:00:25,987 --> 00:00:28,487
(Mandy:)It was just a kiss.
Why would you even tell her?

13
00:00:28,489 --> 00:00:31,319
(Leonard:)Because I didn't want there
to be any secrets between us.

14
00:00:31,325 --> 00:00:32,795
(Mandy:)Is that really the reason?

15
00:00:32,793 --> 00:00:34,963
(Leonard:)What else would it be?

16
00:00:34,962 --> 00:00:36,362
(Penny:)I don't know.

17
00:00:36,364 --> 00:00:38,164
(Mandy:)Sounds like you're trying
to sabotage the relationship.

18
00:00:38,165 --> 00:00:40,395
(Leonard:)No, I don't think so.

19
00:00:40,401 --> 00:00:43,771
(Leonard:)Although,
Penny did say exactly that.

20
00:00:43,771 --> 00:00:46,371
(Mandy:)Okay, well, that's something
to think about.

21
00:00:46,374 --> 00:00:49,404
(Leonard:)You know, on some level,
I've always believed

22
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:51,440
(Leonard:)that I don't deserve
a woman like her.

23
00:00:51,445 --> 00:00:54,385
(Mandy:)Oh, you're gonna
think about that right here?

24
00:00:56,284 --> 00:00:58,384
(Leonard:)I mean, she's really beautiful.

